# API Route Conventions

- Validate request body/params with Zod before processing
- Check authentication: `const session = await auth()`
- Return consistent JSON shape: `{ data } | { error: string }`
- Use proper HTTP status codes (200, 201, 400, 401, 403, 404, 500)
- Log errors with logger from src/lib/logger.ts, not console
- For streaming: use ReadableStream with proper error handling
- Never expose stack traces or internal errors in responses
- Import Zod schemas from src/lib/validation.ts for reuse
